<!--
  Welcome panel (page 0) — the app identity mark: a collage of photos held on the device.

  Converted from the reference mock's SVG. Two tiles overlap: a deep-blue tile carrying a photo
  of three people, and a brighter tile carrying a photo of a cake. The clipped groups reproduce the
  mock's <clipPath> exactly, so the photo content is cropped to its panel the way it is in the
  reference rather than spilling over the tile.

  The blue family follows the theme accent (see the accent ramp in values/attrs.xml) so the mark
  moves with the user's chosen palette. The photographic content — skin, hair, cake, the yellow
  tier of the backdrop — stays fixed: those are the picture, not the chrome.
-->
